The sowing, planting and harvest dates of src/crops.js were written for this
project from the usual dates of French kitchen-garden calendars; they are
guidelines, not the copy of any published table.

The lunar option computes the position of the moon with astronomy-engine
(https://github.com/cosinekitty/astronomy), Copyright (c) 2019-2023 Don Cross,
MIT License. The constellation boundaries come from the table astronomy-engine
ships (IAU 1930 boundaries, Delporte). The method (day types by constellation,
ascending and descending moon, days to avoid) is the one of the biodynamic
sowing calendars made popular by Maria Thun. This integration is not
affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by the Maria Thun publishers, by the
Demeter federation or by icalendrier.fr, whose published calendars were only
used to check the results.
